/08/upgraded-stats-tables-rolling-out-across-sports-reference/\">Upgraded</a>&#10024;</div>    <div class=\"section_heading_text\">\n      <ul>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    \n    \t\t\n</div>\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\n<div class=\"filter switcher\" data-controls=\"#switcher_pbp_stats\">\n\n<div class=\" current\">\n\t<a class=\"sr_preset\" data-hide=\"#all_pbp_stats .section_heading,  #all_pbp_stats .footer,  #all_pbp_stats .topscroll_div\" data-show=\".assoc_pbp_stats, #tfooter_pbp_stats\">Regular Season</a>\n</div><div class=\"\">\n\t<a class=\"sr_preset\" data-hide=\"#all_pbp_stats .section_heading,  #all_pbp_stats .footer,  #all_pbp_stats .topscroll_div\" data-show=\".assoc_pbp_stats_post, #tfooter_pbp_stats_post\">Playoffs</a>\n</div></div>\n\n<div id=\"switcher_pbp_stats\">\n\n\t<div class=\"table_container tabbed current\" id=\"div_pbp_stats\">\n\t\t\n\t\t<table class=\"stats_table sortable row_summable suppress_headers soc\" id=\"pbp_stats\" data-cols-to-freeze=\"1,3\"data-soc-sum-scope-type=\"player_season\"data-soc-sum-phase-type=\"reg\"data-soc-sum-table-type=\"PlayerPBP\"data-soc-sum-entity-id=\"jamesle01\"data-soc-sum-params=\"null\"> <caption>Play-by-Play Table</caption> <colgroup><col><col><col><col><col><col><col><col><col><col><col><col><col><col><col><col><col><col><col><col><col><col><col><col><col></colgroup> <thead> <tr class=\"over_header\"> <th aria-label=\" \" data-stat=\"header_empty_0\" colspan=\"8\" class=\" poptip over_header center\" ></th> <th aria-label=\"Position Estimate\" data-stat=\"header_pos_estimates\" colspan=\"5\" class=\" poptip over_header center\" >Position Estimate</th> <th aria-label=\"+/- Per 100 Poss\" data-stat=\"header_plus_minus\" colspan=\"2\" class=\" poptip over_header center\" >+/- Per 100 Poss</th> <th aria-label=\"Turnovers\" data-stat=\"header_turnovers\" colspan=\"2\" class=\" poptip over_header center\" >Turnovers</th> <th aria-label=\"F