><td class=\"left \" data-stat=\"lg_id\" ><a href=\"/leagues/NBA_2020.html\">NBA</a></td><td class=\"right \" data-stat=\"salary\" csk=\"37436858\" >$37,436,858</td></tr>\n<tr ><th scope=\"row\" class=\"left \" data-stat=\"season\" >2020-21</th><td class=\"left \" data-stat=\"team_name\" ><a href=\"/teams/LAL/2021.html\">Los Angeles Lakers</a></td><td class=\"left \" data-stat=\"lg_id\" ><a href=\"/leagues/NBA_2021.html\">NBA</a></td><td class=\"right \" data-stat=\"salary\" csk=\"39219566\" >$39,219,566</td></tr>\n<tr ><th scope=\"row\" class=\"left \" data-stat=\"season\" >2021-22</th><td class=\"left \" data-stat=\"team_name\" ><a href=\"/teams/LAL/2022.html\">Los Angeles Lakers</a></td><td class=\"left \" data-stat=\"lg_id\" ><a href=\"/leagues/NBA_2022.html\">NBA</a></td><td class=\"right \" data-stat=\"salary\" csk=\"41180544\" >$41,180,544</td></tr>\n<tr ><th scope=\"row\" class=\"left \" data-stat=\"season\" >2022-23</th><td class=\"left \" data-stat=\"team_name\" ><a href=\"/teams/LAL/2023.html\">Los Angeles Lakers</a></td><td class=\"left \" data-stat=\"lg_id\" ><a href=\"/leagues/NBA_2023.html\">NBA</a></td><td class=\"right \" data-stat=\"salary\" csk=\"44474988\" >$44,474,988</td></tr>\n<tr ><th scope=\"row\" class=\"left \" data-stat=\"season\" >2023-24</th><td class=\"left \" data-stat=\"team_name\" ><a href=\"/teams/LAL/2024.html\">Los Angeles Lakers</a></td><td class=\"left \" data-stat=\"lg_id\" ><a href=\"/leagues/NBA_2024.html\">NBA</a></td><td class=\"right \" data-stat=\"salary\" csk=\"47607350\" >$47,607,350</td></tr>\n<tr ><th scope=\"row\" class=\"left \" data-stat=\"season\" >2024-25</th><td class=\"left \" data-stat=\"team_name\" ><a href=\"/teams/LAL/2025.html\">Los Angeles Lakers</a></td><td class=\"left \" data-stat=\"lg_id\" ><a href=\"/leagues/NBA_2025.html\">NBA</a></td><td class=\"right \" data-stat=\"salary\" csk=\"48728845\" >$48,728,845</td></tr>\n</tbody><tfoot><tr ><th scope=\"row\" class=\"left \" data-stat=\"season\" >Career</th><td class=\"left \" data-stat=\"team_name\" >(may be incomplete)</td><td class=\"left iz\" data-stat=\"lg_id\" ></td><td class=\"right \" data-stat=\"salary\" >$531,322,773</td></tr>\n\n   </tfoot>\n\n</table>\n\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"footer no_hide_long\" id=\"tfooter_all_salaries\">\n\n<span class=\"note\">Figures here are a mixture of salaries and cap figures, which are not always the same thing.</span></div>-->\n\n\n</div>\n\n            \n            \n            \n         \n      \n         \n            <div class=\"section_wrapper setup_commented commented\" id=\"all_contract\">\n<div class=\"section_heading assoc_contract\" id=\"contract_sh\">\n  <span class=\"section_anchor\" id=\"contract_link\" data-label=\"Current Contract\"></span><h2>Current Contract</h2>\n      <div class=\"section_heading_text\">\n      <ul><li><span class='salary-pl'>Player Option</span>, <span class='salary-tm'>Team Option</span>&nbsp&nbsp;&#183; &nbsp; <a href='/contracts/'>NBA Contracts Summary</a></li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    \n    \t\t\n</div><div class=\"placeholder\"></div>\n<!--     <div class=\"section_content\" id=\"div_contract\">\n\t    \n<div id=\"all_contracts_lal\" class=\"table_wrapper\">\n\n<div class=\"section_heading assoc_contracts_lal\" id=\"contracts_lal_sh\">\n  <span class=\"section_anchor\" id=\"contracts_lal_link\" data-label=\"\"></span><h2></h2>\n      <div class=\"section_heading_text\">\n      <ul>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    \n    \t\t\n</div>\n<div class=\"table_container\" id=\"div_contracts_lal\">\n    \n    <table class=\"suppress_all sortable stats_table\" id=\"contracts_lal\" data-cols-to-freeze=\",1\">\n    <caption> Table</caption>\n    \n      \n      <tr class=\"thead\">\n         <th aria-label=\"Team\" data-stat=\"Team\" class=\" center\" >Team</th>\n         <th aria-label=\"2025-26\" data-stat=\"2025-26\" class=\" center\" >2025-26</th>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n<td><a href='/contracts/LAL.html'>Los Angeles Lakers</a></td>\n<td><span class='salary-pl'>$52,627,153</span></td>\n</tr>\n\n</table>\n\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"footer no_hide_long\" id=\"tfooter_contracts_lal\">\n\n<div><ul class='bullets'>\n<li>Declined 2021-22 player option to sign extension Thursday, December 3, 2020.</li>\n<li>Signed 4-yr maximum salary contract on Monday, July 9, 2018 2021-22 is player option.</li>\n</ul></div>\n</div>\n\n\n</div>\n\n\t\t\n    </div>\n-->\n</div>\n\n            \n            \n            \n         \n      \n         \n            <div class=\"section_wrapper\" id=\"all_faq\">\n<div class=\"section_heading assoc_faq\" id=\"faq_sh\">\n  <span class=\"section_anchor\" id=\"faq_link\" data-label=\"Frequently Asked Questions\"></span><h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n  \t\t\n</div>    <div class=\"section_content\" id=\"div_faq\">\n\t      <h3>How old is LeBron James?</h3>\n  <p>LeBron James is 41 years old.</p>\n  <h3>Where was LeBron James born?</h3>\n  <p>LeBron James was born in Akron, Ohio.</p>\n  <h3>When was LeBron James born?</h3>\n  <p>LeBron James was born on December 30, 1984.</p>\n  <h3>How tall is LeBron James?</h3>\n  <p>LeBron James is 6-9 (206 cm) tall.</p>\n  <h3>How much does LeBron James weigh?</h3>\n  <p>LeBron James weighs 250 lbs (113 kg).</p>\n  <h3>Is LeBron James in the Hall of Fame?</h3>\n  <p>LeBron James is not in the Hall of Fame.</p>\n  <h3>When was LeBron James drafted?</h3>\n  <p>LeBron James was drafted by <a href=\"/teams/CLE/draft.html\">Cleveland Cavaliers</a>, 1st round (1st pick, 1st overall), <a href=\"/draft/NBA_2003.html\">2003 NBA Draft</a>.</p>\n  <h3>What position does LeBron James play?</h3>\n  <p>Small Forward, Power Forward, Point Guard, Center, and Shooting Guard.</p>\n  <h3>What is LeBron James' net worth?</h3>\n  <p>LeBron James has made at least $531,322,773 playing professional basketball.</p>\n  <h3>How much does LeBron James make?</h3>\n  <p>LeBron James made $48,728,845 in 2025.</p>\n  <h3>What does LeBron James average?</h3>\n  <p>LeBron James averages 20.9 points, 6.1 rebounds, and 7.2 assists per game.</p>\n  <h3>How many rings does LeBron James have?</h3>\n  <p>LeBron James has won 4 championships.</p>\n  <h3>What is LeBron James' Instagram account?</h3>\n  <p>LeBron James is on Instagram at <a href=\"https://instagram.com/kingjames/\">kingjames</a>.</p>\n  <h3>What schools did LeBron James attend?</h3>\n  <p>LeBron James attended St. Vincent-St. Mary in Akron, <a href='/friv/high_schools.fcgi?country=US&state=OH'>Ohio</a>.</p>\n  <h3>What are LeBron James' nicknames?</h3>\n  <p>King James, LBJ, Chosen One, Bron-Bron, The Little Emperor, The Akron Hammer, L-Train, Benjamin Buckets, Captain LeMerica, LeGOAT are nicknames for LeBron James.</p>\n\n\n  <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n    {\n      \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n      \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n      \"mainEntity\": [\n              {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"How old is LeBron James?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"LeBron James is 41 years old.\"\n        }\n      },\n              {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"Where was LeBron James born?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"LeBron James was born in Akron, Ohio.\"\n        }\n      },\n              {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"When was LeBron James born?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"LeBron James was born on December 30, 1984.\"\n        }\n      },\n              {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"How tall is LeBron James?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"LeBron James is 6-9 (206 cm) tall.\"\n        }\n      },\n              {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"How much does LeBron James weigh?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"LeBron James weighs 250 lbs (113 kg).\"\n        }\n      },\n              {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"Is LeBron James in the Hall of Fame?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"LeBron James is not in the Hall of Fame.\"\n        }\n      },\n              {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"When was LeBron James drafted?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"LeBron James was drafted by <a href=\\\"/teams/CLE/draft.html\\\">Cleveland Cavaliers</a>, 1st round (1st pick, 1st overall), <a href=\\\"/draft/NBA_2003.html\\\">2003 NBA Draft</a>.\"\n        }\n      },\n              {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"What position does LeBron James play?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"Small Forward, Power Forward, Point Guard, Center, and Shooting Guard.\"\n        }\n      },\n              {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"What is LeBron James' net worth?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"LeBron James has made at least $531,322,773 playing professional basketball.\"\n        }\n      },\n              {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"How much does LeBron James make?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"LeBron James made $48,728,845 in 2025.\"\n        }\n      },\n              {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"What does LeBron James average?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"LeBron James averages 20.9 points, 6.1 rebounds, and 7.2 assists per game.\"\n        }\n      },\n              {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n     