th aria-label=\"Games Started\" data-stat=\"gs\" scope=\"col\" class=\" poptip center\" data-tip=\"Games Started\" data-over-header=\"Totals\" >GS</th>\n         <th aria-label=\"Minutes Played\" data-stat=\"mp\" scope=\"col\" class=\" poptip center\" data-tip=\"Minutes Played\" data-over-header=\"Totals\" >MP</th>\n         <th aria-label=\"True Shooting Percentage\" data-stat=\"ts_pct\" scope=\"col\" class=\" poptip center\" data-tip=\"<strong>True Shooting Percentage</strong><br>A measure of shooting efficiency that takes into account 2-point field goals, 3-point field goals, and free throws.\" data-over-header=\"Advanced\" >TS%</th>\n         <th aria-label=\"Effective Field Goal Percentage\" data-stat=\"efg_pct\" scope=\"col\" class=\" poptip center\" data-tip=\"<strong>Effective Field Goal Percentage</strong><br>This statistic adjusts for the fact that a 3-point field goal is worth one more point than a 2-point field goal.\" data-over-header=\"Advanced\" >eFG%</th>\n         <th aria-label=\"Offensive Rebound Percentage\" data-stat=\"orb_pct\" scope=\"col\" class=\" poptip center\" data-tip=\"<b>Offensive Rebound Percentage</b><br>An estimate of the percentage of available offensive rebounds a player grabbed while they were on the floor.\" data-over-header=\"Advanced\" >ORB%</th>\n         <th aria-label=\"Defensive Rebound Percentage\" data-stat=\"drb_pct\" scope=\"col\" class=\" poptip center\" data-tip=\"<b>Defensive Rebound Percentage</b><br>An estimate of the percentage of available defensive rebounds a player grabbed while they were on the floor.\" data-over-header=\"Advanced\" >DRB%</th>\n         <th aria-label=\"Total Rebound Percentage\" data-stat=\"trb_pct\" scope=\"col\" class=\" poptip center\" data-tip=\"<b>Total Rebound Percentage</b><br>An estimate of the percentage of available rebounds a player grabbed while they were on the floor.\" data-over-header=\"Advanced\" >TRB%</th>\n         <th aria-label=\"Assist Percentage\" data-stat=\"ast_pct\" scope=\"col\" class=\" poptip center\" data-tip=\"<b>Assist Percentage</b><br>An estimate of the percentage of teammate field goals a player assisted while they were on the floor.\" data-over-header=\"Advanced\" >AST%</th>\n         <th aria-label=\"Steal Percentage\" data-stat=\"stl_pct\" scope=\"col\" class=\" poptip center\" data-tip=\"<b>Steal Percentage</b><br>An estimate of the percentage of opponent possessions that end with a steal by the player while they were on the floor.\" data-over-header=\"Advanced\" >STL%</th>\n         <th aria-label=\"Block Percentage\" data-stat=\"blk_pct\" scope=\"col\" class=\" poptip center\" data-tip=\"<b>Block Percentage</b><br>An estimate of the percentage of opponent two-point field goal attempts blocked by the player while they were on the floor.\" data-over-header=\"Advanced\" >BLK%</th>\n         <th aria-label=\"Turnover Percentage\" data-stat=\"tov_pct\" scope=\"col\" class=\" poptip sort_default_asc center\" data-tip=\"<b>Turnover Percentage</b><br>An estimate of turnovers committed per 100 plays.\" data-over-header=\"Advanced\" >TOV%</th>\n         <th aria-label=\"Usage Percentage\" data-stat=\"usg_pct\" scope=\"col\" class=\" poptip center\" data-tip=\"<b>Usage Percentage</b><br>An estimate of the percentage of team plays used by a player while they were on the floor.\" data-over-header=\"Advanced\" >USG%</th>\n         <th aria-label=\"Offensive Rating\" data-stat=\"off_rtg\" scope=\"col\" class=\" poptip center\" data-tip=\"<b>Offensive Rating</b><br>An estimate of points produced (players) or scored (teams) per 100 possessions\" data-over-header=\"Advanced\" >ORtg</th>\n         <th aria-label=\"Defensive Rating\" data-stat=\"def_rtg\" scope=\"col\" class=\" poptip sort_default_asc center\" data-tip=\"<b>Defensive Rating</b><br>An estimate of points allowed per 100 possessions\" data-over-header=\"Advanced\" >DRtg</th>\n         <th aria-label=\"GmSc\" data-stat=\"game_score\" scope=\"col\" class=\" poptip center