    "gold_text": "2020 NBA Finals Heat vs. Lakers League Champion: Los Angeles Lakers Finals MVP: LeBron James (29.8 / 11.8 / 8.5) 2020 Playoff Leaders: PTS: Anthony Davis (582) TRB: LeBron James (226) AST: LeBron James (184) WS: Anthony Davis (4.5) #5 Miami Heat (2-4) vs. #1 Los Angeles Lakers (4-2) Game 1, Sep 30 Miami Heat 98 Final Los Angeles Lakers 116 PTS A. Davis-LAL 34 TRB L. James-LAL 13 Game 2, Oct 2 Miami Heat 114 Final Los Angeles Lakers 124 PTS L. James-LAL 33 TRB A. Davis-LAL 14 Game 3, Oct 4 Los Angeles Lakers 104 Final Miami Heat 115 PTS J. Butler-MIA 40 TRB J. Butler-MIA 11 Game 4, Oct 6 Los Angeles Lakers 102 Final Miami Heat 96 PTS L. James-LAL 28 TRB L. James-LAL 12 Game 5, Oct 9 Miami Heat 111 Final Los Angeles Lakers 108 PTS L. James-LAL 40 TRB L. James-LAL 13 Game 6, Oct 11 Los Angeles Lakers 106 Final Miami Heat 93 PTS L. James-LAL 28 TRB A. Davis-LAL"
  },
