l=\"G\" data-stat=\"games\" scope=\"col\" class=\" poptip center\" data-tip=\"Games\" >G</th> <th aria-label=\"GS\" data-stat=\"games_started\" scope=\"col\" class=\" poptip center\" data-tip=\"Games Started\" >GS</th> <th aria-label=\"MP\" data-stat=\"mp\" scope=\"col\" class=\" poptip center\" data-tip=\"Minutes Played\" >MP</th> <th aria-label=\"FG%\" data-stat=\"fg_pct\" scope=\"col\" class=\" poptip hide_non_quals center\" data-tip=\"Field Goal Percentage\" data-filter=\"1\" data-name=\"\" >FG%</th> <th aria-label=\"2P%\" data-stat=\"fg2_pct\" scope=\"col\" class=\" poptip hide_non_quals center\" data-tip=\"2-Point Field Goal Percentage\" data-filter=\"1\" data-name=\"\" >2P%</th> <th aria-label=\"3P%\" data-stat=\"fg3_pct\" scope=\"col\" class=\" poptip hide_non_quals center\" data-tip=\"3-Point Field Goal Percentage\" data-filter=\"1\" data-name=\"\" >3P%</th> <th aria-label=\"eFG%\" data-stat=\"efg_pct\" scope=\"col\" class=\" poptip hide_non_quals center\" data-tip=\"<strong>Effective Field Goal Percentage</strong><br>This statistic adjusts for the fact that a 3-point field goal is worth one more point than a 2-point field goal.\" data-filter=\"1\" data-name=\"\" >eFG%</th> <th aria-label=\"FT%\" data-stat=\"ft_pct\" scope=\"col\" class=\" poptip hide_non_quals center\" data-tip=\"Free Throw Percentage\" data-filter=\"1\" data-name=\"\" >FT%</th> <th aria-label=\"TS%\" data-stat=\"ts_pct\" scope=\"col\" class=\" poptip hide_non_quals center\" data-tip=\"<strong>True Shooting Percentage</strong><br>A measure of shooting efficiency that takes into account 2-point field goals, 3-point field goals, and free throws.\" data-filter=\"1\" data-name=\"\" >TS%</th> <th aria-label=\"FTr\" data-stat=\"fta_per_fga_pct\" scope=\"col\" class=\" poptip hide_non_quals center\" data-tip=\"<strong>Free Throw Attempt Rate</strong><br>Number of FT Attempts Per FG Attempt\" data-filter=\"1\" data-name=\"\" >FTr</th> <th aria-label=\"3PAr\" data-stat=\"fg3a_per_fga_pct\" scope=\"