A_2015.html\">NBA</a></td><td class=\"right \" data-stat=\"salary\" csk=\"10000000\" >$10,000,000</td></tr>\n<tr ><th scope=\"row\" class=\"left \" data-stat=\"season\" >2015-16</th><td class=\"left \" data-stat=\"team_name\" ><a href=\"/teams/SAS/2016.html\">San Antonio Spurs</a></td><td class=\"left \" data-stat=\"lg_id\" ><a href=\"/leagues/NBA_2016.html\">NBA</a></td><td class=\"right \" data-stat=\"salary\" csk=\"5000000\" >$5,000,000</td></tr>\n<tr ><th scope=\"row\" class=\"left \" data-stat=\"season\" >2016-17</th><td class=\"left \" data-stat=\"team_name\" ><a href=\"/teams/SAS/2017.html\">San Antonio Spurs</a></td><td class=\"left \" data-stat=\"lg_id\" ><a href=\"/leagues/NBA_2017.html\">NBA</a></td><td class=\"right \" data-stat=\"salary\" csk=\"1881250\" >$1,881,250</td></tr>\n<tr ><th scope=\"row\" class=\"left \" data-stat=\"season\" >2017-18</th><td class=\"left \" data-stat=\"team_name\" ><a href=\"/teams/SAS/2018.html\">San Antonio Spurs</a></td><td class=\"left \" data-stat=\"lg_id\" ><a href=\"/leagues/NBA_2018.html\">NBA</a></td><td class=\"right \" data-stat=\"salary\" csk=\"1881250\" >$1,881,250</td></tr>\n<tr ><th scope=\"row\" class=\"left \" data-stat=\"season\" >2018-19</th><td class=\"left \" data-stat=\"team_name\" ><a href=\"/teams/SAS/2019.html\">San Antonio Spurs</a></td><td class=\"left \" data-stat=\"lg_id\" ><a href=\"/leagues/NBA_2019.html\">NBA</a></td><td class=\"right \" data-stat=\"salary\" csk=\"1881250\" >$1,881,250</td></tr>\n</tbody><tfoot><tr ><th scope=\"row\" class=\"left \" data-stat=\"season\" >Career</th><td class=\"left \" data-stat=\"team_name\" >(may be incomplete)</td><td class=\"left iz\" data-stat=\"lg_id\" ></td><td class=\"right \" data-stat=\"salary\" >$245,352,905</td></tr>\n\n   </tfoot>\n\n</table>\n\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"footer no_hide_long\" id=\"tfooter_all_salaries\">\n\n<span class=\"note\">Figures here are a mixture of salaries and cap figures, which are not always the same thing.</span></div>-->\n\n\n</div>\n\n            \n            \n            \n         \n      \n         \n      \n         \n            <div class=\"section_wrapper\" id=\"all_faq\">\n<div class=\"section_heading assoc_faq\" id=\"faq_sh\">\n  <span class=\"section_anchor\" id=\"faq_link\" data-label=\"Frequently Asked Questions\"></span><h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n  \t\t\n</div>    <div class=\"section_content\" id=\"div_faq\">\n\t      <h3>How old is Tim Duncan?</h3>\n  <p>Tim Duncan is 50 years old.</p>\n  <h3>Where was Tim Duncan born?</h3>\n  <p>Tim Duncan was born in St. Croix, U.S. Virgin Islands.</p>\n  <h3>When was Tim Duncan born?</h3>\n  <p>Tim Duncan was born on April 25, 1976.</p>\n  <h3>How tall is Tim Duncan?</h3>\n  <p>Tim Duncan is 6-11 (211 cm) tall.</p>\n  <h3>How much did Tim Duncan weigh when playing?</h3>\n  <p>Tim Duncan weighed 250 lbs (113 kg) when playing.</p>\n  <h3>Is Tim Duncan in the Hall of Fame?</h3>\n  <p>Tim Duncan was inducted to the Hall of Fame as a Player in 2020 (<a href=\"/awards/hof.html\">Full List</a>)\n.</p>\n  <h3>When was Tim Duncan drafted?</h3>\n  <p>Tim Duncan was drafted by <a href=\"/teams/SAS/draft.html\">San Antonio Spurs</a>, 1st round (1st pick, 1st overall), <a href=\"/draft/NBA_1997.html\">1997 NBA Draft</a>.</p>\n  <h3>What position did Tim Duncan play?</h3>\n  <p>Center and Power Forward.</p>\n  <h3>When did Tim Duncan retire?</h3>\n  <p>Tim Duncan last played in 2016.</p>\n  <h3>What is Tim Duncan's net worth?</h3>\n  <p>Tim Duncan made at least $245,352,905 playing professional basketball.</p>\n  <h3>How much did Tim Duncan make?</h3>\n  <p>Tim Duncan made $22,183,220 in 2010.</p>\n  <h3>What did Tim Duncan average?</h3>\n  <p>Tim Duncan averaged 19.0 points, 10.8 rebounds, and 3.0 assists per game.</p>\n  <h3>How many rings does Tim Duncan have?</h3>\n  <p>Tim Duncan won 5 championships.</p>\n  <h3>What schools did Tim Duncan attend?</h3>\n  <p>Tim Duncan attended Saint Dunstan's Episcopal in Saint Croix, U.S. Virgin Islands and <a href='/friv/colleges.fcgi?college=wake'>Wake Forest</a>.</p>\n  <h3>What are Tim Duncan's nicknames?</h3>\n  <p>Timmy, The Big Fundamental, Groundhog Day, Old Man Riverwalk, The Stone Buddha are nicknames for Tim Duncan.</p>\n\n\n  <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n    {\n      \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n      \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n      \"mainEntity\": [\n              {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"How old is Tim Duncan?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"Tim Duncan is 50 years old.\"\n        }\n      },\n              {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"Where was Tim Duncan born?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"Tim Duncan was born in St. Croix, U.S. Virgin Islands.\"\n        }\n      },\n              {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"When was Tim Duncan born?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"Tim Duncan was born on April 25, 1976.\"\n        }\n      },\n              {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"How tall is Tim Duncan?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"Tim Duncan is 6-11 (211 cm) tall.\"\n        }\n      },\n              {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"How much did Tim Duncan weigh when playing?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"Tim Duncan weighed 250 lbs (113 kg) when playing.\"\n        }\n      },\n              {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"Is Tim Duncan in the Hall of Fame?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"Tim Duncan was inducted to the Hall of Fame as a Player in 2020 (<a href=\\\"/awards/hof.html\\\">Full List</a>)\\n.\"\n        }\n      },\n              {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"When was Tim Duncan drafted?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"Tim Duncan was drafted by <a href=\\\"/teams/SAS/draft.html\\\">San Antonio Spurs</a>, 1st round (1st pick, 1st overall), <a href=\\\"/draft/NBA_1997.html\\\">1997 NBA Draft</a>.\"\n        }\n      },\n              {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"What position did Tim Duncan play?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"Center and Power Forward.\"\n        }\n      },\n              {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"When did Tim Duncan retire?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"Tim Duncan last played in 2016.\"\n        }\n      },\n              {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"What is Tim Duncan's net worth?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"Tim Duncan made at least $245,352,905 playing professional basketball.\"\n        }\n      },\n              {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"How much did Tim Duncan make?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"Tim Duncan made $22,183,220 in 2010.\"\n        }\n      },\n              {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"What did Tim Duncan average?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"Tim Duncan averaged 19.0 points, 10.8 rebounds, and 3.0 assists per game.\"\n        }\n      },\n              {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"How many rings does Tim Duncan have?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"Tim Duncan won 5 championships.\"\n        }\n      },\n              {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"What schools did Tim Duncan attend?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"Tim Duncan attended Saint Dunstan's Episcopal in Saint Croix, U.S. Virgin Islands and <a href='/friv/colleges.fcgi?college=wake'>Wake Forest</a>.\"\n        }\n      },\n              {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"What are Tim Duncan's nicknames?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"Timmy, The Big Fundamental, Groundhog Day, Old Man Riverwalk, The Stone Buddha are nicknames for Tim Duncan.\"\n        }\n      }\n      ]\n    }\n</script>\n\n\t\t\n    </div>\n\n</div>\n\n            \n            \n            \n         \n      \n         \n            <div class=\"section_wrapper setup_commented commented\" id=\"all_7232229656\">\n<div class=\"section_heading assoc_7232229656\" id=\"7232229656_sh\">\n  <span class=\"section_anchor\" id=\"7232229656_link\" data-label=\"Name + &quot;Statistics&quot; Translations\"></span><h2>Name + &quot;Statistics&quot; Translations</h2>\n      <div class=\"section_heading_text\">\n      <ul><li>Note, this is done in an automated way, so we apologize for any errors, &amp; please <a href=\"/feedback/\">report any suggested corrections.</a> \"Statistics\" is included to allow non-English speakers to find our pages.</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n    \n    \t\t\n</div><div class=\"placeholder\"></div>\n<!--     <div class=\"section_content\" id=\"div_7232229656\">\n\t    <p>Catalan: Tim Duncan EstadÃ­stiques</p>\n\n<p>Czech: Tim Duncan Statistiky</p>\n\n<p>Danish: Tim Duncan Statistik</p>\n\n<p>German: Tim Duncan Statistik</p>\n\n<p>Greek, Modern (1453-): Î¤Î¹Î¼ ÎÏÎ¬Î½ÎºÎ±Î½ Î£ÏÎ±ÏÎ¹ÏÏÎ¹ÎºÎ¬</p>\n\n<p>Spanish: Tim Duncan EstadÃ­sticas</p>\n\n<p>Estonian: Tim Duncan Statistika</p>\n\n<p>Persian: ØªÛÙ Ø¯Ø§ÙÚ©Ù Ø¢ÙØ§Ø±</p>\n\n<p>Finnish: Tim Duncan tilastot</p>\n\n<