    "gold_text": "Tim Duncan Timothy Theodore Duncan (Timmy, The Big Fundamental, Groundhog Day, Old Man Riverwalk, The Stone Buddha) Position: Center and Power Forward ▪ Shoots: Right 6-11, 250lb (211cm, 113kg) Born: April 25, 1976 (Age: 49-364d) in St. Croix, U.S. Virgin Islands College: Wake Forest High School: Saint Dunstan's Episcopal in Saint Croix, U.S. Virgin Islands Draft: San Antonio Spurs, 1st round (1st pick, 1st overall), 1997 NBA Draft NBA Debut: October 31, 1997 Hall of Fame: Inducted as Player in 2020 (Full List) Career Length: 19 years Hall of Fame 15x All Star 5x NBA Champ 15x All-NBA 15x All-Defensive 1997-98 All-Rookie 1997-98 ROY 3x Finals MVP 1999-00 AS MVP 2x MVP NBA 75th Anniv. Team Transactions June 25, 1997: Drafted by the San Antonio Spurs in the 1st round (1st pick) of the 1997 NBA Draft. July 9, 2015: Signed a multi-year contract with the San Antonio Spurs. July 11, 2016: Announced retirement. July 12, 2016: Waived by the San Antonio Spurs. Move made for salary cap purposes post-retirement Frequently Asked Questions How old is Tim Duncan? Tim Duncan is 49 years old. Where was Tim Duncan born? Tim Duncan was born in St. Croix, U.S. Virgin Islands. When was Tim Duncan born? Tim Duncan was born on April 25, 1976. How tall is Tim Duncan? Tim Duncan is 6-11 (211 cm) tall. How much did Tim Duncan weigh when playing? Tim Duncan weighed 250 lbs (113 kg) when playing. Is Tim Duncan in the Hall of Fame? Tim Duncan was inducted to the Hall of Fame as a Player in 2020 (Full List). When was Tim Duncan drafted? Tim Duncan was drafted by San Antonio Spurs, 1st round (1st pick, 1st overall), 1997 NBA Draft. What position did Tim Duncan play? Center and Power Forward. When did Tim Duncan retire? Tim Duncan last played in 2016. What is Tim Duncan's net worth? Tim Duncan made at least $245,352,905 playing professional basketball. How much did Tim Duncan make? Tim Duncan made $22,183,220 in 2010. What did Tim Duncan average? Tim Duncan averaged 19.0 points, 10.8 rebounds, and 3.0 assists per game. How many rings does Tim Duncan have? Tim Duncan won 5 championships. What schools did Tim Duncan attend? Tim Duncan attended Saint Dunstan's Episcopal in Saint Croix, U.S. Virgin Islands and Wake Forest. What are Tim Duncan's nicknames? Timmy, The Big Fundamental, Groundhog Day, Old Man Riverwalk, The Stone Buddha are nicknames for Tim Duncan. Name + \"Statistics\" Translations Arabic: ليبرون جيمز إحصاءات Catalan: LeBron James Estadístiques Czech: LeBron James Statistiky Danish: LeBron James Statistik German: LeBron James Statistik Greek, Modern (1453-): ΛεΜπρόν Τζέιμς Στατιστικά Spanish: LeBron James Estadísticas Estonian: LeBron James Statistika Persian: لبران جیمز آمار Finnish: LeBron James tilastot French: LeBron James statistiques Galician: LeBron James Estatísticas Hebrew: לברון ג'יימס סטטיסטיקה Croatian: LeBron James Statistika Hungarian: LeBron James Statisztika Armenian: Լեբրոն Ջեյմս վիճակագրություն Indonesian: LeBron James Statistik Italian: LeBron James statistiche Japanese: レブロン・ジェームズ 成績 Korean: 르브론 제임스 통계 Lithuanian: LeBron James Statistika Latvian: Lebrons Džeimss statistika Mongolian: Леброн Жеймс Статистик Dutch: LeBron James Statistieken Norwegian: LeBron James statistikk Polish: LeBron James Statystyki Portuguese: LeBron James estatísticas Russian: Джеймс, Леброн Статистика Slovak: LeBron James štatistiky Slovenian: LeBron James statistika Serbian: Lebron Džejms Статистика Swedish: LeBron James Statistik Turkish: LeBron James İstatistikleri Ukrainian: Леброн Джеймс Статистика Volap: LeBron James nunäds Chinese: 勒布朗·詹姆斯 數據"
