g Table</caption> <colgroup><col><col><col><col><col><col><col><col><col><col><col><col><col><col><col><col><col><col><col><col><col><col><col><col><col><col></colgroup> <thead> <tr class=\"over_header\"> <th aria-label=\" \" data-stat=\"header_empty_0\" colspan=\"7\" class=\" poptip over_header center\" ></th> <th aria-label=\"Shooting %\" data-stat=\"block_auto_header_Shooting %\" colspan=\"8\" class=\" poptip over_header center\" >Shooting %</th> <th aria-label=\"League-Adjusted\" data-stat=\"header_lg_adj\" colspan=\"8\" class=\" poptip over_header center\" >League-Adjusted</th> <th aria-label=\"Added\" data-stat=\"block_auto_header_Added\" colspan=\"2\" class=\" poptip over_header center\" >Added</th> <th></th> </tr> <tr> <th aria-label=\"Rk\" data-stat=\"ranker\" scope=\"col\" class=\"ranker poptip center\" data-tip=\"Rank\" >Rk</th> <th aria-label=\"Player\" data-stat=\"name_display\" scope=\"col\" class=\" poptip sort_default_asc center\" >Player</th> <th aria-label=\"Age\" data-stat=\"age\" scope=\"col\" class=\" poptip center\" data-tip=\"Player's age on January 31 of the season\" >Age</th> <th aria-label=\"Pos\" data-stat=\"pos\" scope=\"col\" class=\" poptip center\" data-tip=\"Position\" >Pos</th> <th aria-label=\"G\" data-stat=\"games\" scope=\"col\" class=\" poptip center\" data-tip=\"Games\" >G</th> <th aria-label=\"GS\" data-stat=\"games_started\" scope=\"col\" class=\" poptip center\" data-tip=\"Games Started\" >GS</th> <th aria-label=\"MP\" data-stat=\"mp\" scope=\"col\" class=\" poptip center\" data-tip=\"Minutes Played\" >MP</th> <th aria-label=\"FG%\" data-stat=\"fg_pct\" scope=\"col\" class=\" poptip hide_non_quals center\" data-tip=\"Field Goal Percentage\" data-filter=\"1\" data-name=\"\" >FG%</th> <th aria-label=\"2P%\" data-stat=\"fg2_pct\" scope=\"col\" class=\" poptip hide_non_quals center\" data-tip=\"2-Point Field Goal Percentage\" data-filter=\"1\" data-name=\"\" >2P%</th> <th aria-label=\"3P%\" data-stat=\"fg3_pct\" scope=\"col\" class=\" poptip hide_non_quals center\" data-tip=\"3-Point Field Goal Percentage\" data-filter=\"1\" data-name=\"\" >3P%</th> <th aria-label=\"eFG%\" data-stat=\"efg_pct\" scope=\"col\" class=\" poptip hide_non_quals center\" data-tip=\"<strong>Effective Field Goal Percentage</strong><br>This statistic adjusts for the fact that a 3-point field goal is worth one more point than a 2-point field goal.\" data-filter=\"1\" data-name=\"\" >eFG%</th> <th aria-label=\"FT%\" data-stat=\"ft_pct\" scope=\"col\" class=\" poptip hide_non_quals center\" data-tip=\"Free Throw Percentage\" data-filter=\"1\" data-name=\"\" >FT%</th> <th aria-label=\"TS%\" data-stat=\"ts_pct\" scope=\"col\" class=\" poptip hide_non_quals center\" data-tip=\"<strong>True Shooting Percentage</strong><br>A measure of shooting efficiency that takes into account 2-point field goals, 3-point field goals, and free throws.\" data-filter=\"1\" data-name=\"\" >TS%</th> <th aria-label=\"FTr\" data-stat=\"fta_per_fga_pct\" scope=\"col\" class=\" poptip hide_non_quals center\" data-tip=\"<strong>Free Throw Attempt Rate</strong><br>Number of FT Attempts Per FG Attempt\" data-filter=\"1\" data-name=\"\" >FTr</th> <th aria-label=\"3PAr\" data-stat=\"fg3a_per_fga_pct\" scope=\"col\" class=\" poptip hide_non_quals center\" data-tip=\"<strong>3-Point Attempt Rate</strong><br>Percentage of FG Attempts from 3-Point Range\" data-filter=\"1\" data-name=\"\" >3PAr</th> <th aria-label=\"FG+\" data-stat=\"adj_fg_pct\" scope=\"col\" class=\" poptip center\" data-tip=\"<strong>Adjusted FG%</strong><br/>100*[FG%/lgFG%]. Career total weighted by seasonal FGA.\" >FG+</th> <th aria-label=\"2P+\" data-stat=\"adj_fg2_pct\" scope=\"col\" class=\" poptip center\" data-tip=\"<strong>Adjusted 2-Pt FG%</strong><br/>100*[2FG%/lg2FG%]. Career total weighted by 2-Pt seasonal FG.\" >2P+</th> <th aria-label=\"3P+\" data-stat=\"adj_fg3_pct\" scope=\"col\" class=\" poptip center\" data-tip=\"<strong>Adjusted 3-Pt FG%</strong><br/>100*[3FG%/lg3FG%].