ghbr03.html\">Brandan Wright</a> to a contract for the rest of the season.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>February 14, 2018</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/j/johnsjo02.html\">Joe Johnson</a> to a contract for the rest of the season.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>March 24, 2018</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/n/nashle01.html\">Le'Bryan Nash</a> to a 10-day contract.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>March 30, 2018</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/q/quartti01.html\">Tim Quarterman</a> to a multi-year contract.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>April 11, 2018</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/j/jacksaa01.html\">Aaron Jackson</a> to a contract for the rest of the season.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>June 21, 2018:</strong> Selected <a href=\"/players/m/meltode01.html\">De'Anthony Melton</a> (2nd round, 46th pick) in the <a href=\"/draft/NBA_2018.html\">2018 NBA Draft</a>.</p></li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>June 22, 2018</strong>: Traded cash to the <a data-attr-from=\"UTA\" href=\"/teams/UTA/2018.html\">Utah Jazz</a> for <a href=\"/players/e/edwarvi01.html\">Vince Edwards</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>July 6, 2018</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/c/cartemi01.html\">Michael Carter-Williams</a> as a free agent.</p>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>July 6, 2018</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/c/clarkga01.html\">Gary Clark</a>.</p>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>July 6, 2018</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/e/edwarvi01.html\">Vince Edwards</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>July 7, 2018</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/p/paulch01.html\">Chris Paul</a> as a free agent.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>July 9, 2018</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/g/greenge01.html\">Gerald Green</a> as a free agent.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>July 13, 2018</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/e/ennisja01.html\">James Ennis</a> as a free agent.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>July 25, 2018</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/h/harteis01.html\">Isaiah Hartenstein</a> to a multi-year contract.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>July 27, 2018</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/c/capelca01.html\">Clint Capela</a> as a free agent.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>August 2, 2018</strong>: Traded <a href=\"/players/o/onuakch01.html\">Chinanu Onuaku</a>, cash and a 2020 2nd round draft pick to the <a data-attr-to=\"DAL\" href=\"/teams/DAL/2019.html\">Dallas Mavericks</a> for <a href=\"/players/l/leunema01.html\">Maarty Leunen</a>. $1,544,951 2020 2nd-rd pick is right to swap GSW's pick for HOU's pick, did not convey</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>August 10, 2018</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/g/grayro01.html\">Rob Gray</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>August 13, 2018</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/a/anthoca01.html\">Carmelo Anthony</a> as a free agent.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>August 31, 2018</strong>: Traded <a href=\"/players/a/anderry01.html\">Ryan Anderson</a> and <a href=\"/players/m/meltode01.html\">De'Anthony Melton</a> to the <a data-attr-to=\"PHO\" href=\"/teams/PHO/2019.html\">Phoenix Suns</a> for <a href=\"/players/c/chrisma01.html\">Marquese Chriss</a> and <a href=\"/players/k/knighbr03.html\">Brandon Knight</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>October, 2018</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/g/gential01.html\">Alessandro Gentile</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>October 12, 2018</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/b/bondti01.html\">Tim Bond</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>October 15, 2018</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/e/edwarvi01.html\">Vince Edwards</a> to a two-way contract.</p>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>October 15, 2018</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/c/clarkga01.html\">Gary Clark</a> to a two-way contract.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>November 26, 2018</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/h/houseda01.html\">Danuel House</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>December 6, 2018</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/h/houseda01.html\">Danuel House</a> to a two-way contract.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>December 24, 2018</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/r/riverau01.html\">Austin Rivers</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>January 7, 2019</strong>: Traded <a href=\"/players/c/cartemi01.html\">Michael Carter-Williams</a> and cash to the <a data-attr-to=\"CHI\" href=\"/teams/CHI/2019.html\">Chicago Bulls</a> for a 2020 2nd round draft pick. Conditional 2020 2nd-rd pick did not convey</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>January 16, 2019</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/n/nunnaja01.html\">James Nunnally</a> to a 10-day contract.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>January 21, 2019</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/f/farieke01.html\">Kenneth Faried</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>January 22, 2019</strong>: Traded <a href=\"/players/a/anthoca01.html\">Carmelo Anthony</a>, <a href=\"/players/d/diebljo01.html\">Jon Diebler</a> and cash to the <a data-attr-to=\"CHI\" href=\"/teams/CHI/2019.html\">Chicago Bulls</a> for <a href=\"/players/d/dragita01.html\">Tadija Dragićević</a>. $1.56MM</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>February 7, 2019</strong>: As part of a 3-team trade, the <a data-attr-from=\"HOU\" href=\"/teams/HOU/2019.html\">Houston Rockets</a> traded a 2020 2nd round draft pick (<a href=\"/players/m/martike04.html\">Kenyon Martin Jr.</a> was later selected) to the <a data-attr-to=\"SAC\" href=\"/teams/SAC/2019.html\">Sacramento Kings</a>; the <a data-attr-from=\"HOU\" href=\"/teams/HOU/2019.html\">Houston Rockets</a> traded <a href=\"/players/c/chrisma01.html\">Marquese Chriss</a>, <a href=\"/players/k/knighbr03.html\">Brandon Knight</a>, a 2019 1st round draft pick (<a href=\"/players/w/windldy01.html\">Dylan Windler</a> was later selected) and a 2022 2nd round draft pick (<a href=\"/players/n/nembhan01.html\">Andrew Nembhard</a> was later selected) to the <a data-attr-to=\"CLE\" href=\"/teams/CLE/2019.html\">Cleveland Cavaliers</a>; the <a data-attr-from=\"CLE\" href=\"/teams/CLE/2019.html\">Cleveland Cavaliers</a> traded <a href=\"/players/b/baldwwa01.html\">Wade Baldwin</a>, <a href=\"/players/s/stausni01.html\">Nik Stauskas</a> and a 2021 2nd round draft pick (<a href=\"/players/m/mamuksa01.html\">Sandro Mamukelashvili</a> was later selected) to the <a data-attr-to=\"HOU\" href=\"/teams/HOU/2019.html\">Houston Rockets</a>; the <a data-attr-from=\"CLE\" href=\"/teams/CLE/2019.html\">Cleveland Cavaliers</a> traded <a href=\"/players/b/burksal01.html\">Alec Burks</a> to the <a data-attr-to=\"SAC\" href=\"/teams/SAC/2019.html\">Sacramento Kings</a>; and  the <a data-attr-from=\"SAC\" href=\"/teams/SAC/2019.html\">Sacramento Kings</a> traded <a href=\"/players/s/shumpim01.html\">Iman Shumpert</a> to the <a data-attr-to=\"HOU\" href=\"/teams/HOU/2019.html\">Houston Rockets</a>. 2020 2nd-rd pick is less favorable of HOU or GSW 2021 2nd-rd pick is MIL own 2019 1st-rd pick is HOU own and is top-14 protected 2022 2nd-rd pick is HOU own</p>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>February 7, 2019</strong>: Traded <a href=\"/players/e/ennisja01.html\">James Ennis</a> to the <a data-attr-to=\"PHI\" href=\"/teams/PHI/2019.html\">Philadelphia 76ers</a> for a 2021 2nd round draft pick. 2021 2nd-rd pick is a right to swap, did not convey</p>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>February 7, 2019</strong>: Traded <a href=\"/players/b/baldwwa01.html\">Wade Baldwin</a>, <a href=\"/players/l/leunema01.html\">Maarty Leunen</a>, <a href=\"/players/s/stausni01.html\">Nik Stauskas</a> and a 2021 2nd round draft pick (<a href=\"/players/m/mamuksa01.html\">Sandro Mamukelashvili</a> was later selected) to the <a data-attr-to=\"IND\" href=\"/teams/IND/2019.html\">Indiana Pacers</a> for cash.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>February 22, 2019</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/c/chiozch01.html\">Chris Chiozza</a> to a 10-day contract.</p>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>February 22, 2019</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/j/joneste01.html\">Terrence Jones</a> to a 10-day contract.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>March 23, 2019</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/c/chiozch01.html\">Chris Chiozza</a> to a contract for the rest of the season.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>April 7, 2019</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/f/frazimi01.html\">Michael Frazier</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>July 16, 2019</strong>: Traded <a href=\"/players/p/paulch01.html\">Chris Paul</a>, a 2021 1st round draft pick, a 2024 1st round draft pick (<a href=\"/players/t/topicni01.html\">Nikola Topić</a> was later selected), a 2025 1st round draft pick and a 2026 1st round draft pick to the <a data-attr-from=\"OKC\" href=\"/teams/OKC/2020.html\">Oklahoma City Thunder</a> for <a href=\"/players/w/westbru01.html\">Russell Westbrook</a>. 2024 pick is top-4 protected 2026 pick is top-4 protected, becomes $1MM and 2026 second-round pick 2021 1st-rd pick is right to swap, top-4 protected, did not convey 2025 1st-rd pick is right to swap with HOU, top-20 protected; became PHO pick, did not convey and OKC got nothing</p>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>July 16, 2019</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/h/houseda01.html\">Danuel House</a> as a free agent.</p>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>July 16, 2019</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/r/riverau01.html\">Austin Rivers</a> as a free agent.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>July 18, 2019</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/c/chandty01.html\">Tyson Chandler</a> as a free agent.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>July 22, 2019</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/g/greenge01.html\">Gerald Green</a> as a free agent.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>July 23, 2019</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/m/mclembe01.html\">Ben McLemore</a> as a free agent.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>July 25, 2019</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/b/bennean01.html\">Anthony Bennett</a> as a free agent.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>September 4, 2019</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/p/pondssh01.html\">Shamorie Ponds</a> to a two-way contract.</p>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>September 4, 2019</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/m/mcdowwi01.html\">William McDowell-White</a> to a two-way contract.</p>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>September 4, 2019</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/g/gordoer01.html\">Eric Gordon</a> to a multi-year contract. (Signing is extension on deal signed in 2016)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>September 6, 2019</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/h/hilarne01.html\">Nenê</a> as a free agent.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>September 23, 2019</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/s/sefolth01.html\">Thabo Sefolosha</a> as a free agent.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>September 27, 2019</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/a/anderry01.html\">Ryan Anderson</a> as a free agent.</p>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>September 27, 2019</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/b/blossja01.html\">Jaron Blossomgame</a> as a free agent.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>October 20, 2019</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/f/frazimi01.html\">Michael Frazier</a> to a two-way contract.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>October 21, 2019</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/c/clemoch01.html\">Chris Clemons</a> to a two-way contract.</p>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>October 21, 2019</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/s/shabaro01.html\">Ronshad Shabazz</a> to a two-way contract.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>December 27, 2019</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/h/howarwi01.html\">William Howard</a> to a two-way contract.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>February 5, 2020</strong>: As part of a 4-team trade, the <a data-attr-from=\"HOU\" href=\"/teams/HOU/2020.html\">Houston Rockets</a> traded <a href=\"/players/g/greenge01.html\">Gerald Green</a> and a 2020 1st round draft pick (<a href=\"/players/n/nnajize01.html\">Zeke Nnaji</a> was later selected) to the <a data-attr-to=\"DEN\" href=\"/teams/DEN/2020.html\">Denver Nuggets</a>; the <a data-attr-from=\"HOU\" href=\"/teams/HOU/2020.html\">Houston Rockets</a> traded <a href=\"/players/c/capelca01.html\">Clint Capela</a> and <a href=\"/players/h/hilarne01.html\">Nene</a> to the <a data-attr-to=\"ATL\" href=\"/teams/ATL/2020.html\">Atlanta Hawks</a>; the <a data-attr-from=\"ATL\" href=\"/teams/ATL/2020.html\">Atlanta Hawks</a> traded a 2024 2nd round draft pick (<a href=\"/players/l/larsspe01.html\">Pelle Larsson</a> was later selected) to the <a data-attr-to=\"HOU\" href=\"/teams/HOU/2020.html\">Houston Rockets</a>; the <a data-attr-from=\"ATL\" href=\"/teams/ATL/2020.html\">Atlanta Hawks</a> traded <a href=\"/players/t/turneev01.html\">Evan Turner</a> and a 2020 1st round draft pick (<a href=\"/players/p/pokusal01.html\">Aleksej Pokusevski</a> was later selected) to the <a data-attr-to=\"MIN\" href=\"/teams/MIN/2020.html\">Minnesota Timberwolves</a>; the <a data-attr-from=\"DEN\" href=\"/teams/DEN/2020.html\">Denver Nuggets</a> traded <a href=\"/players/b/beaslma01.html\">Malik Beasley</a>, <a href=\"/players/h/hernaju01.html\">Juan Hernangomez</a> and <a href=\"/players/v/vandeja01.html\">Jarred Vanderbilt</a> to the <a data-attr-to=\"MIN\" href=\"/teams/MIN/2020.html\">Minnesota Timberwolves</a>; the <a data-attr-from=\"MIN\" href=\"/teams/MIN/2020.html\">Minnesota Timberwolves</a> traded <a href=\"/players/b/bateske01.html\">Keita Bates-Diop</a>, <a href=\"/players/n/napiesh01.html\">Shabazz Napier</a> and <a href=\"/players/v/vonleno01.html\">Noah Vonleh</a> to the <a data-attr-to=\"DEN\" href=\"/teams/DEN/2020.html\">Denver Nuggets</a>; and  the <a data-attr-from=\"MIN\" href=\"/teams/MIN/2020.html\">Minnesota Timberwolves</a> traded <a href=\"/players/b/belljo01.html\">Jordan Bell</a> and <a href=\"/players/c/covinro01.html\">Robert Covington</a> to the <a data-attr-to=\"HOU\" href=\"/teams/HOU/2020.html\">Houston Rockets</a>. (Pick is GSW's 2024 second-round pick)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>February 6, 2020</strong>: Traded <a href=\"/players/b/belljo01.html\">Jordan Bell</a> and a 2023 2nd round draft pick to the <a data-attr-from=\"MEM\" href=\"/teams/MEM/2020.html\">Memphis Grizzlies</a> for <a href=\"/players/c/cabocbr01.html\">Bruno Caboclo</a>. 2023 2nd-rd pick was a protected right to swap, did not convey</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>February 18, 2020</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/g/greenje02.html\">Jeff Green</a> to a 10-day contract.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>February 20, 2020</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/c/carrode01.html\">DeMarre Carroll</a> to a contract for the rest of the season.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>February 28, 2020</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/g/greenje02.html\">Jeff Green</a> to a contract for the rest of the season.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>June 23, 2020</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/n/nwabada01.html\">David Nwaba</a> to a multi-year contract.</p>\n</li>\n</div>\n<h3 class='sectionhead'>Philadelphia 76ers Franchise&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span>(November 2, 2020 - Present)</span></h3>\n<div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>November 18, 2020:</strong> Selected <a href=\"/players/m/maxeyty01.html\">Tyrese Maxey</a> (1st round, 21st pick), <a href=\"/players/m/maledth01.html\">Théo Maledon</a> (2nd round, 34th pick), <a href=\"/players/b/beyty01.html\">Tyler Bey</a> (2nd round, 36th pick), <a href=\"/players/j/joeis01.html\">Isaiah Joe</a> (2nd round, 49th pick) and <a href=\"/players/r/reedpa01.html\">Paul Reed</a> (2nd round, 58th pick) in the <a href=\"/draft/NBA_2020.html\">2020 NBA Draft</a>.</p><p class=\"transaction \"><strong>November 18, 2020</strong>: Traded <a href=\"/players/b/beyty01.html\">Tyler Bey</a> and <a href=\"/players/r/richajo01.html\">Josh Richardson</a> to the <a data-attr-from=\"DAL\" href=\"/teams/DAL/2021.html\">Dallas Mavericks</a> for <a href=\"/players/c/curryse01.html\">Seth Curry</a>. Philadelphia also received a trade exception from Dallas.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>November 19, 2020</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/m/mathida01.html\">Dakota Mathias</a> to a two-way contract.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>November 21, 2020</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/h/howardw01.html\">Dwight Howard</a> as a free agent.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>November 23, 2020</strong>: Traded <a href=\"/players/s/smithzh01.html\">Zhaire Smith</a> to the <a data-attr-to=\"DET\" href=\"/teams/DET/2021.html\">Detroit Pistons</a> for <a href=\"/players/b/bradlto01.html\">Tony Bradley</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>November 27, 2020</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/a/anderju01.html\">Justin Anderson</a> to a multi-year contract.</p>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>November 27, 2020</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/j/joeis01.html\">Isaiah Joe</a> to a multi-year contract.</p>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>November 27, 2020</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/r/reedpa01.html\">Paul Reed</a> to a two-way contract.</p>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>November 27, 2020</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/b/broekry01.html\">Ryan Broekhoff</a>.</p>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>November 27, 2020</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/w/waltode01.html\">Derrick Walton Jr.</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>December 2, 2020</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/m/maxeyty01.html\">Tyrese Maxey</a> to a multi-year contract.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>December 8, 2020</strong>: Traded <a href=\"/players/h/horfoal01.html\">Al Horford</a>, <a href=\"/players/m/maledth01.html\">Théo Maledon</a>, <a href=\"/players/m/micicva01.html\">Vasilije Micić</a> and a 2026 1st round draft pick to the <a data-attr-to=\"OKC\" href=\"/teams/OKC/2021.html\">Oklahoma City Thunder</a> for <a href=\"/players/f/fergute01.html\">Terrance Ferguson</a>, <a href=\"/players/g/greenda02.html\">Danny Green</a> and <a href=\"/players/p/poirivi01.html\">Vincent Poirier</a>. 2025 1st-rd pick (PHI own) is top-6 protected, did not convey Philadelphia also received a trade exception from Oklahoma City.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>January 22, 2021</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/t/tuckera01.html\">Rayjon Tucker</a> to a two-way contract.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>March 25, 2021</strong>: As part of a 3-team trade, the <a data-attr-from=\"PHI\" href=\"/teams/PHI/2021.html\">Philadelphia 76ers</a> traded <a href=\"/players/b/bradlto01.html\">Tony Bradley</a>, a 2025 2nd round draft pick (<a href=\"/players/b/broomjo01.html\">Johni Broome</a> was later selected) and a 2026 2nd round draft pick to the <a data-attr-to=\"OKC\" href=\"/teams/OKC/2021.html\">Oklahoma City Thunder</a>; the <a data-attr-from=\"PHI\" href=\"/teams/PHI/2021.html\">Philadelphia 76ers</a> traded <a href=\"/players/f/fergute01.html\">Terrance Ferguson</a>, <a href=\"/players/p/poirivi01.html\">Vincent Poirier</a>, <a href=\"/players/p/preldem01.html\">Emir Preldžić</a>, a 2021 2nd round draft pick (<a href=\"/players/s/simsje01.html\">Jericho Sims</a> was later selected) and a 2024 2nd round draft pick to the <a data-attr-to=\"NYK\" href=\"/teams/NYK/2021.html\">New York Knicks</a>; the <a data-attr-from=\"NYK\" href=\"/teams/NYK/2021.html\">New York Knicks</a> traded <a href=\"/players/r/riverau01.html\">Austin Rivers</a> to the <a data-attr-to=\"OKC\" href=\"/teams/OKC/2021.html\">Oklahoma City Thunder</a>; the <a data-attr-from=\"NYK\" href=\"/teams/NYK/2021.html\">New York Knicks</a> traded <a href=\"/players/b/brazdig01.html\">Ignas Brazdeikis</a> to the <a data-attr-to=\"PHI\" href=\"/teams/PHI/2021.html\">Philadelphia 76ers</a>; and  the <a data-attr-from=\"OKC\" href=\"/teams/OKC/2021.html\">Oklahoma City Thunder</a> traded <a href=\"/players/h/hillge01.html\">George Hill</a> to the <a data-attr-to=\"PHI\" href=\"/teams/PHI/2021.html\">Philadelphia 76ers</a>. 2021 2nd-rd pick is PHI own 2024 2nd-rd (MIA own) was top-55 protected, did not convey. 2025 2nd-rd pick is PHI own 2026 2nd-rd pick is PHI own</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>March 26, 2021</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/j/jonesma05.html\">Mason Jones</a> to a two-way contract.</p>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>March 26, 2021</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/r/reedpa01.html\">Paul Reed</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>April 12, 2021</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/t/tollian01.html\">Anthony Tolliver</a> to a 10-day contract.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>May 2, 2021</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/t/tollian01.html\">Anthony Tolliver</a> to a contract for the rest of the season.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>May 11, 2021</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/c/clarkga01.html\">Gary Clark</a> to a two-way contract.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>July 29, 2021:</strong> Selected <a href=\"/players/s/sprinja01.html\">Jaden Springer</a> (1st round, 28th pick), <a href=\"/players/p/petrufi01.html\">Filip Petrušev</a> (2nd round, 50th pick) and <a href=\"/players/b/bassech01.html\">Charles Bassey</a> (2nd round, 53rd pick) in the <a href=\"/draft/NBA_2021.html\">2021 NBA Draft</a>.</p></li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>August 3, 2021</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/t/tuckera01.html\">Rayjon Tucker</a> to a two-way contract.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>August 4, 2021</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/d/drumman01.html\">Andre Drummond</a>.</p>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>August 4, 2021</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/s/sprinja01.html\">Jaden Springer</a> to a multi-year contract.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>August 6, 2021</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/n/niangge01.html\">Georges Niang</a> to a multi-year contract.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>August 7, 2021</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/g/greenda02.html\">Danny Green</a> to a multi-year contract.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>August 8, 2021</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/h/henryaa01.html\">Aaron Henry</a> to a two-way contract.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>August 9, 2021</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/k/korkmfu01.html\">Furkan Korkmaz</a> to a multi-year contract.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>August 30, 2021</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/r/rillegr01.html\">Grant Riller</a> to a two-way contract.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>September 24, 2021</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/b/bassech01.html\">Charles Bassey</a> to a multi-year contract.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>September 27, 2021</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/h/harrish01.html\">Shaquille Harrison</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>October 12, 2021</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/k/keybr01.html\">Braxton Key</a>.</p>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>October 12, 2021</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/b/brownja04.html\">Jared Brownridge</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class