, 23rd pick) in the <a href=\"/draft/NBA_2022.html\">2022 NBA Draft</a>.</p></li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>June 24, 2022</strong>: Traded <a href=\"/players/g/greenda02.html\">Danny Green</a> and <a href=\"/players/r/roddyda01.html\">David Roddy</a> to the <a data-attr-from=\"MEM\" href=\"/teams/MEM/2022.html\">Memphis Grizzlies</a> for <a href=\"/players/m/meltode01.html\">De'Anthony Melton</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>July 1, 2022</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/q/queentr01.html\">Trevelin Queen</a> to a multi-year contract.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>July 2, 2022</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/c/champju02.html\">Julian Champagnie</a> to a two-way contract.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>July 6, 2022</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/t/tuckepj01.html\">P.J. Tucker</a> to a multi-year contract.</p>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>July 6, 2022</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/h/houseda01.html\">Danuel House</a> to a multi-year contract.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>July 27, 2022</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/h/hardeja01.html\">James Harden</a> to a multi-year contract.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>September 13, 2022</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/h/harremo01.html\">Montrezl Harrell</a> to a multi-year contract.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>October 8, 2022</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/m/mccluma01.html\">Mac McClung</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>October 10, 2022</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/m/mccawpa01.html\">Patrick McCaw</a>.</p>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>October 10, 2022</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/m/mayssk01.html\">Skylar Mays</a>.</p>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>October 10, 2022</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/s/smithju02.html\">Justin Smith</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>October 12, 20