2nd round draft pick and a 2031 2nd round draft pick to the <a data-attr-to=\"DET\" href=\"/teams/DET/2025.html\">Detroit Pistons</a> for cash.  2027 2nd-rd pick is MIL own 2031 2nd-rd pick is DAL own Philadelphia also received a trade exception</p>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>February 6, 2025</strong>: Traded <a href=\"/players/j/jacksre01.html\">Reggie Jackson</a> and a 2026 1st round draft pick to the <a data-attr-to=\"WAS\" href=\"/teams/WAS/2025.html\">Washington Wizards</a> for <a href=\"/players/b/butleja02.html\">Jared Butler</a>, a 2027 2nd round draft pick, a 2028 2nd round draft pick, a 2030 2nd round draft pick and a 2030 2nd round draft pick.  2026 1st-rd pick is least favorable 2027 2nd-rd pick is more favorable 2028 2nd-rd pick is GSW own 2030 2nd-rd pick is more favorable 2030 2nd-rd pick is WAS own and Philadelphia receives a trade exception</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>February 7, 2025</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/o/okekech01.html\">Chuma Okeke</a> to a 10-day contract.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>February 11, 2025</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/r/roddyda01.html\">David Roddy</a> to a 10-day contract.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>February 21, 2025</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/r/reeseal01.html\">Alex Reese</a> to a two-way contract.</p>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>February 21, 2025</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/r/roddyda01.html\">David Roddy</a> to a two-way contract.</p>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>February 21, 2025</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/w/walkelo01.html\">Lonnie Walker</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>March 1, 2025</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/h/hoodsja01.html\">Jalen Hood-Schifino</a> to a two-way contract.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"transaction \"><strong>March 14, 2025</strong>: Signed <a href=\"/players/b/brissos01.html\">Oshae Brissett</a> to a 10-day contract.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p 